# PCP Nexus Installed Version Runtime Issues

## Current Objective
Debug and fix the installed version of PCP Nexus that launches but fails to process emails correctly and freezes on certain UI interactions.

## Known Issues
- ✅ App launches successfully (Tcl/Tk bundling fixed)
- ❌ Email processing not working correctly
- ❌ UI freezes when hitting certain buttons

---

## Tasks

### [ ] Phase 1: Issue Investigation
- [ ] Locate current source code and build artifacts
- [ ] Identify which buttons cause freezing
- [ ] Compare dev version vs installed version behavior
- [ ] Review debug logs from installed version
- [ ] Test email processing flow step-by-step

### [ ] Phase 2: Root Cause Analysis
- [ ] Identify missing dependencies or imports
- [ ] Check for path resolution issues in frozen mode
- [ ] Verify Outlook COM automation in frozen mode
- [ ] Check for threading/async issues causing freezes
- [ ] Validate config file loading

### [ ] Phase 3: Fix Implementation
- [ ] Fix email processing logic for frozen mode
- [ ] Fix UI freezing issues
- [ ] Add better error handling/logging
- [ ] Test fixes in development mode
- [ ] Rebuild installer with fixes

### [ ] Phase 4: Validation
- [ ] Test installed version on development machine
- [ ] Verify email processing works end-to-end
- [ ] Verify all UI buttons respond correctly
- [ ] Test on clean VM if needed
